<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">Ayṯ-Ufasus</para>
  <para style="toc3">Afa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayṯ-Ufasus</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Ufasus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Ufasus</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s">Lmuqaddima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Nec ḏ Bulus, nec ḏ ijjen n arrasul n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ s ȓxaḍar n Arebbi. <char style="it">Uriɣ ṯabrat-a</char> i ṣṣaliḥin <char style="it">iy iǧan ḏi jwayeh n Ufasus</char> iy yumnen s Ƹisa. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lbaraka n Arebbi ṯemmuc-aneɣ-d ḏi Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Aḏ itwabarek Arebbi, Babas n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. U ḏi Lmasiḥ ibarek-aneɣ <char style="it">Siḏi Arebbi</char> zi mkuȓ lbaraka ruḥiya ig iǧan ḏeg ijennaṯen.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ijennaṯen ḏ ljameƹ ujenna.</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Cuf, ixḍar-aneɣ ḏi Lmasiḥ qbeȓ ma d ixȓeq ddunect-a bac a niȓi neṣfa bȓa ȓƹib zzaṯes. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />S ȓemḥibbeṯ nnes izemmem-aneɣ bac aḏaneɣ itbenna am ṯarwa nnes s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ƹlaḥsab lɣaraḍ n ȓxaḍar nnes. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Aḏ itwabarek arḍa nnes imɣaren, ifareɣ-iṯ-iḏ xaneɣ Arebbi s Mmis iƹizzen. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Ifekk-aneɣ-d <char style="it">Siḏi Arebbi</char> s lfidya nni n Mmis iƹni s iḏammen nnes bac aḏ twaɣfarent ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nneɣ ƹlaḥsab agȓa n arḍa nnes. <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />Arḍa-ya ifareɣ-aneɣ-ṯ-iḏ <char style="it">Siḏi Arebbi</char> s marra ȓefhameṯ ḏ ṯusna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯusna nettaṯ ḏ lmaƹrifa.</char></note> nnes. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />U ƹlaḥsab lɣaraḍ nnes ig igga ḏi Lmasiḥ isbeyyen-aneɣ-d ȓmaƹna inuffaren n ȓxaḍar nnes. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Ȓmaƹna-ya inuffaren ixeṭṭeṭ-it-id bac aḏ tebḏa ṯṣeǧaḥ ḏi ȓweqṯ nnes nican bac aḏ ismun Arebbi marra ṯimesȓayin ḏi Lmasiḥ, iƹni ṯimesȓayin ḏeg ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Marra ṯimesȓayin itegg-iṯent Arebbi ƹlaḥsab min ixeṭṭeṭ ḏ min ixḍar netta. Neccin ḏi Ƹisa yarra-aneɣ Arebbi a nwareṯ ƹlaḥsab min izemmem netta s lɣaraḍ nnes. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Ḥima neccin iy yumnen ḏ imezwura ḏi Lmasiḥ a neḥmeḏ Arebbi x lƹaḍama nnes. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Ṯumma ismun-ikenniw-d ƹaweḏ ak Lmasiḥ wami ṯṣennṭem i wawaȓ n lḥaqiqa iƹni Lʼinjil iy zi ṯnejmem. Wami ṯumnem iḍbeƹ-ikenniw Arebbi s ṭṭabaƹ nnes iƹni s Arruḥ iqeddsen iy zi ḏaneɣ iwƹeḏ. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Arruḥ-a netta ḏ ijjen n ȓƹarbun iḍemmen lwareṯ nneɣ aȓ ɣa ṯ neṭṭef ṯumma a neḥmeḏ Arebbi x lƹaḍama nnes.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itettar i Arebbi x Ayṯ-Ufasus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />X manaya, nec zeg wami tuɣa tesȓiɣ x lʼiman nwem zi Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem i marra ṣṣaliḥin <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />tcekkareɣ Arebbi xawem bȓa ma aḏ beddeɣ u <char style="it">ȓebda</char> tfekkareɣ ḏaywem ḏi ṯẓaǧiṯ inu. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Ḥima Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ƹaḍim n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ aḏawem d yuc ijjen n arruḥ n ȓefhameṯ, kenniw aḏ tƹeȓmem x min inuffaren bac aḏ tessnem Siḏi Arebbi mliḥ. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Aḏawem d yuc ijjen n nnur i wuȓawen nwem bac aḏ tessnem min iƹna lʼamal-a iy zi ḏawem d iȓaɣa, ḏ min iƹna wagȓa-ya n lwareṯ ƹaḍim n ṣṣaliḥin, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />ḏ min iƹna jjheḏ nnes imɣaren bȓa ȓeqyas ɣar neccin iy yumnen. Jjheḏ-a am wenni ig isexḏem Arebbi s lquwwa nnes <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />ig igga ḏi Lmasiḥ wami ṯiḏ isekkar zi ȓmewṯ isɣim-iṯ x ufusi nnes ḏeg ijennaṯen. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Isuƹȓa-ṯ Arebbi aṭṭas x marra ȓeḥkam ḏ ȓmexzen ḏ jjheḏ ḏ lmemlaka. Isuƹȓa-ṯ netta ƹaweḏ x kuȓ isem iy teggen ḏ isemawen, maci ɣir ḏi zman-a iy ḏi neǧa waha walakin ƹaweḏ ḏi lʼaxira. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Igga Arebbi ƹaweḏ marra ṯimesȓayin swadday iḍaren nnes iggi-ṯ ḏ azeǧif iy itrayyan x marra ṯimesȓayin ḏi jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Jmaƹeṯ-a nettaṯ iy iǧan ḏ ddat n Lmasiḥ u zzayes nettaṯ iy iccur yixef nnes u ḏ netta iy iccuren marra ḏi min ḏi ma.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">S arḍa n Siḏi Arebbi iy zi ɣa nenjem u ṣafi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Fa kenniw tuɣa ṯemmuṯem <char style="it">s wuȓawen nwem</char> ƹlaḥsab ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ ḏ ddnub nwem. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Ḏaysent iy tuɣa tƹicem xmi ṯeggurem ḏeg ubriḏ n ddunect-a ṯḏeffarem arrayes n ȓeḥkam iy iǧan jar ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ <char style="it">iƹni Cciṭan</char> iy iǧan netta ḏ arruḥ nni ig ixeddmen ḏeg yinni iy iƹeṣṣan Arebbi. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Neccin marra tuɣa netƹic am niṯni ḏeg yijjen n ȓweqṯ wami tuɣa netseƹƹaf ccehawaṯ n array aƹeffan n nnefs nneɣ nḏeffar min irezzu ḏ min itfekkar. Tuɣaneɣ am marra iwḏan iƹni neccin zeg yinni iy ɣa iƹaqeb Siḏi Arebbi. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Walakin Arebbi s ȓemḥibbeṯ nnes iy igga i neccin ḏ arraḥmeṯ nnes ṯameqqrant aṭṭas, <char style="it">min ḏaneɣ igga netta?</char> <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />Iseddar-aneɣ-d ak Lmasiḥ waxxa neccin <char style="it">s wuȓawen nneɣ</char> nemmuṯ ƹlaḥsab ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nneɣ. Iwa s arḍa <char style="it">n Siḏi Arebbi</char> iy zi nenjem. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Ṯumma isekkar-aneɣ-d ak Lmasiḥ isɣim-aneɣ ḏeg imucan n ujenna s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Mayemmi? Ḥima <char style="it">Siḏi Arebbi</char> ḏi zmanaṯ iy d ɣa yasen aḏ d ismeḍhar agȓa nnes iƹni arḍa nnes mecḥaȓ ig iǧa ḏ ameqqran bȓa ȓeqyas iy ḏaneɣ d isbeyyen ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Aqa s arḍa <char style="it">n Siḏi Arebbi</char> iy zi ṯnejmem wami ṯumnem. Manaya war zzaywem d itekk ca zi kenniw; Lla, manaya itekk-d zi lhadiya n Arebbi. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Manaya maci ƹlaḥsab lḥasanaṯ nwem lla, bac uȓa ḏ ijjen war iteftaxar ca zeg yixef nnes. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Liʼanna neccin ḏ ȓxeḏmeṯ n Siḏi Arebbi, ixȓeq-aneɣ-d ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ bac a negg ȓexḏayem ṯiṣebḥanin. Niṯenti isewjeḏ-aneɣ-ṯent-id Arebbi zi qbeȓ bac aṯent nexḏem.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Neccin ȓmuminin ḏ ijjen s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Iwa ƹeqȓeṯ belli kenniw tuɣa ṯeǧam zeg yinni itwasemman ḏ lkuffar zaƹma, war ṯeggim ca ṭṭahareṯ. Amenni iy qqaren yinni iteggen ṭṭahareṯ (iƹni <char style="it">ɣir</char> min teggen ḏi ddat s ifassen n bnaḏem <char style="it">waha</char>). <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Ƹeqȓeṯ belli ḏi ȓweqṯ nni tbeƹƹaḏem x Lmasiḥ tenƹezaȓem zi ljinsiya n ccaƹb n Arebbi. Aqa kenniw ḏ ibarraniyen ƹlaḥsab ṯimesȓayin nni iy zi d iwƹeḏ Arebbi ḏi ȓƹuhuḏ nnes. Kenniw tuɣa ṯeǧam bȓa lʼamal bȓa Arebbi ḏi ddunect-a. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Walakin wami ṯumnem zi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ, kenniw iy tuɣa ṯuggwjem aṭṭas <char style="it">zi Arebbi </char> qbeȓ, ṣafi ȓexxu isqarreb-ikenniw-d ɣares s iḏammen n Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Cuf, Lmasiḥ netta s yixef nnes ḏ ȓehna nneɣ. Ḏ netta ig ismunen <char style="it">Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏ ȓegnus nneɣni igga</char> ṯnayen n ccuƹub-a ḏeg yijjen n ccaƹb. S ddat n Lmasiḥ ihḏem ȓḥiḍ nni iy tuɣa ḏaneɣ iferrqen s lƹadawa jaraneɣ. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />S ddat nnes isbeṭṭeȓ ccariƹa nni s ȓuṣiyaṯ nnes ḏ lqawanin nnes bac aḏ igg ḏeg yixef nnes ijjen n ccaƹb waḥḏes ḏ jḏiḏ ḏeg umcan n ṯnayen n ccuƹub nni. Amenni igga ȓehna. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Amenni isemṣȓaḥ ṯnayen n ccuƹub-a ak Arebbi yarri-ṯen ḏ ijjen n ccaƹb s ṣṣalib, inɣa zzayes lƹadawa jarasen. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Aqa yusa-d Ƹisa itbeccar netta s Lʼinjil yuwi-awem-d ȓehna i kenniw tuɣa iǧan ṯbeƹƹḏem <char style="it">x Arebbi</char> u ḏ yinni iy d yuḏsen <char style="it">ɣar Arebbi</char>. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Liʼanna s Lmasiḥ am neccin am kenniw nzemmar a nqarreb ɣar Arebbi Babaṯneɣ s yijjen n Arruḥ iqeddsen.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Iḏen, ȓexxu kenniw war ṯeqqimem ca ḏ ibarraniyen niɣ ḏ imezḏaɣ. Lla, ȓexxu kenniw ḏ imƹacaren ak ṣṣaliḥin iƹni yuca-awem Arebbi ljinsiya akiḏsen ṯḏewȓem ḏ ȓeḥbab n ṯeddarṯ n Arebbi. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Ṯaddarṯ-a nettaṯ ṯebna x dsas n yizra iy iǧan ḏ arrusul ḏ lʼanbiya. U Lmasiḥ s yixef nnes aqaṯ ḏ azru nni iy iǧan ḏeg umcan aṣebḥan ḏi ṯɣemmarṯ n dsas nnes. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Ḏayes ḏi netta iy imun marra ȓebni n ṯeddarṯ-a tgaƹƹaḏ ḏ icten bac aḏ tiȓi ḏ ijjen n ṯemziḏa ḏ ṯamqeddest i Arebbi. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Ḏayes ƹaweḏ ḏi Lmasiḥ ibenna-kenniw ijjen ak unneɣni bac aḏ tiȓim ḏ ijjen n ṯzeddiɣṯ ḏayes iy ɣa izḏeɣ Arebbi s Arruḥ nnes.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Imeḍhar-d ȓmaƹna inuffaren x Lʼinjil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />X manaya <char style="it">terkaƹeɣ x ifadden inu,</char> nec Bulus iy iǧan ḏ ameḥbus ƹlaḥsab Ƹisa Lmasiḥ u xawem kenniw iy war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil...<verse eid="EPH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Ma ṯesȓam niɣ lla x lmesʼuliya nni, iƹni ijjen n lbaraka iy ḏayi yuca Arebbi xawem kenniw? <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Iƹni ȓmaƹna inuffaren x Lʼinjil ismeḍhar-ayi-iṯ-iḏ isehwa-ṯ-iḏ xafi s lwaḥi mamc ḏawem t uriɣ cwayt zi qbeȓ. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Xmi ɣa ṯɣarem manaya aḏ tessnem ȓefhameṯ inu iy ɣari ḏi ȓmaƹna-ya inuffaren x Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Ȓmaƹna-ya war ṯiḏ ismeḍhar ca Arebbi i ṯarwa n Adam ḏi zmanaṯ iy iƹḏun am mammec ṯiḏ ismeḍhar ȓexxu s Arruḥ iqeddsen i arrusul ṣṣaliḥin ak lʼanbiya. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Ȓmaƹna-ya inuffaren ṯanita, min ṯeƹna? Aqa uȓa ḏ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏ warṯen <char style="it">zi Arebbi</char> ak Ayṯ-Israʼil s Lʼinjil. Niṯni ḏ ijjen n jmaƹeṯ, marra aḏ carcen ḏi min iwƹeḏ Arebbi ḏi Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Ḏewȓeɣ ḏ axeddam n Lʼinjil-a ƹlaḥsab lbaraka n Arebbi wami ḏayi t ihḏa isexḏem-it s jjheḏ nnes. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Lbaraka-ya yuca-ayi-t Arebbi waxxa ḏ amezyan iy ǧiɣ x marra ṣṣaliḥin bac nec aḏ beccareɣ yinni war iǧin ca zi Ayṯ-Israʼil aḏ ssnen agȓa nni n Lmasiḥ iy war itwacerriḥen ca. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Ƹaweḏ bac aḏ seḍhareɣ mliḥ i marra iwḏan min ixeṭṭeṭ Arebbi ḏi ȓmaƹna nni inuffaren ig ijja netta ḏeg yixef nnes ḏi zmanaṯ iy iƹḏun u ḏ netta ḏ Lxaliq n marra min iǧan ḏ ṯimesȓayin. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Min ixeṭṭeṭ netta? Yinni ig iḥekkmen ḏ yinni ig ijehḏen ḏeg ijennaṯen ȓexxu aḏ ssnen x ufus n jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin min ṯeƹna ȓefhameṯ n Arebbi x marra ṯimesȓayin. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Manaya iǧa ƹlaḥsab lɣaraḍ n Arebbi zi ȓebda, u lɣaraḍ-a ikemmeȓ-iṯ s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Zzayes netta a nqarreb ɣar Arebbi s zƹameṯ ḏ ttiqeṯ bȓa ma a neggweḏ xmi zzayes ntamen. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Falihaḏa nniɣ-awem war tefciȓeṯ ca ƹlaḥsab aƹeddeb inu xawem ȓaḥeqqac manaya akenniw infeƹ.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itẓaǧa x ȓmuminin n Ayṯ-Ufasus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />
    <char style="it">Nniɣ-awem</char> x manaya nec terkaƹeɣ x ifadden inu zzaṯ i Babaṯneɣ. <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />Zzayes netta iy d tekken isemawen n lʼaṣel n marra ȓeḥbab n ujenna ḏ ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Tettareɣ i Arebbi zeg wagȓa nnes aƹḍim akenniw isejheḏ ḏi nnefs nwem s ufus n Arruḥ nnes <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />ḥima Lmasiḥ aḏ izḏeɣ ḏeg wuȓawen nwem s lʼiman. Tettareɣ i Arebbi ƹaweḏ aḏ twaẓẓum aḏ tuwṯem mliḥ iẓewran ḏeg ucaȓ n ȓemḥibbeṯ <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />bac aḏ yiȓi ɣarwem jjheḏ ak marra ṣṣaliḥin aḏ tzemmarem aḏ tfehmem mecḥaȓ ṯiȓiw mecḥaȓ ṯazeyrarṯ mecḥaȓ ṯuƹȓa mecḥaȓ ṯuǧeɣ <char style="it">ȓemḥibbeṯ n Lmasiḥ</char>. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Aḏ tessnem ƹaweḏ mliḥ ȓemḥibbeṯ-a ṯanita n Lmasiḥ mecḥaȓ ṯemɣer x marra ṯusna <char style="it">ḏi ddunect-a</char> bac aḏ teccarem s min iccur Arebbi.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Iwa Siḏi Arebbi ḏ netta iy izemmaren aḏ igg aṭṭas s waṭṭas zi min ḏas ntettar niɣ ḏ min netxeyyal ƹlaḥsab jjheḏ nnes iy ixeddmen ḏayneɣ. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Aɣares ṯiȓi lƹaḍama ḏi jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin u ƹaweḏ ḏi Ƹisa Lmasiḥ zi ljil ɣar ljil i ȓebda n ȓebdaṯ. Amin!<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Neccin marra ḏ ijjen ḏi jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Iḏen fa nec ig iǧan ḏ ameḥbus x ssabab n Siḏiṯneɣ akenniw nhiɣ bac aḏ tuyurem nican ƹlaḥsab awaȓ nni iy ḏawem d iȓaɣan zeg ujenna. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Iȓim bȓa ttakebbur qaƹ. Iȓim s yijjen n ttawaḍuƹ. Ṣbarem ak wayawya s ttasiƹ n ȓxaḍar ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Ggeṯ marra lmejhud nwem bac aḏ tiȓim ḏ ijjen ḏi Arruḥ iqeddsen wami ṯeṭṭfem fus ḏeg ufus s ȓehna. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" /><char style="bd">Jmaƹeṯ ḏ icten, Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏ ijjen. Amenni Arebbi wami ḏawem d iȓaɣa, iȓaɣa-yawem-d ɣar lʼamal ḏ ijjen. </char> <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" /><char style="bd">Siḏiṯneɣ ḏ ijjen, lʼiman ḏ ijjen, ṭṭahareṯ s waman ḏ icten.</char> <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" /><char style="bd">Arebbi Babaṯneɣ n marra ḏ ijjen. Aqaṯ x marra, iƹeddu-d x marra, aqaṯ ḏi marra. </char><verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Cuf, kuȓ ijjen zzayneɣ ṯemmuc-as yijjen n lbaraka ƹlaḥsab mammec t iwzen Lmasiḥ ḏ lhadiya. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />X manaya iqqar <char style="it">Lkitab</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">&lt;Wami igaƹƹeḏ ɣar umcan nni iy yuƹȓan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">yuwi akiḏes xarebbi ḏ imeḥbas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">yuca-asen lhadiyaṯ i iryazen.&gt;<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />(Min ixes aḏ yini belli netta igaƹƹeḏ? Iƹni ixes aḏ yini belli netta ihwa-d ƹaweḏ ɣar imucan iy yuǧɣen ḏi ṯmurṯ. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Wah, wenni iy d ihwan ḏ wenni s yixef nnes ig igaƹƹḏen qaƹ ḏeg ujenna n ijennaṯen bac aḏ iccar marra ṯimesȓayin.) <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Ḏ netta ig ixḍaren arrusul ḏ lʼanbiya ḏ yinni ig itbeccaren s Lʼinjil ḏ ȓfuqaha ḏ imseȓmaḏen. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Niṯni aḏ swejḏen i ṣṣaliḥin aḏ xeḏmen ccɣeȓ n Arebbi bac jmaƹeṯ n Lmasiḥ aḏ tejheḏ. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Aȓ ɣa niȓi marra ḏ ijjen ḏi lʼiman u ḏi ṯusna x Mmis n Arebbi. Aȓ ɣa niȓi marra ƹaweḏ nemɣar iƹni ḏ iryazen am ȓaƹbar nni ikmaȓ n ȓqedd n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Amenni war netɣimi ca ḏ iḥenjiren tawint-aneɣ ȓemwaj tarrant-aneɣ. Niɣ ḏ arriḥ itṣuḍ xaneɣ ikessi-yaneɣ ssa ḏ ssa s kuȓ arriḥ zaƹma n useȓmeḏ u s ṯeḥraymiṯ ḏ ixarwiḍen n iryazen ḏ min tciṭṭinen. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Lla, innama neccin xmi nessawaȓ ȓḥaqq s ȓemḥibbeṯ labud a nemɣar s kuȓ abriḏ a niȓi am netta ḏ azeǧif nni itrayyan xaneɣ iƹni Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Zzayes zi Lmasiḥ ddat ṯekmaȓ n jmaƹeṯ ṯmun aqat ḏ icten s qaƹ ȓemfaseȓ nni iy ḏayes. U kuȓ ṭṭarf nnes meȓa ixeddem nican ataf aḏ isemɣer ddat-a u s yixef nnes aḏ tebna s ȓemḥibbeṯ.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abriḏ n jḏiḏ n ȓmuminin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Aqa min ḏawem qqareɣ ḏ uziyyar-a iy xawem tzeyyareɣ ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ, iƹni u labud war ṯeggurem ca mammec gguren ȓegnus s ȓaƹquȓ nsen ixwan. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Niṯni ṯṭemmeṣ-iṯen ȓefhameṯ zaƹma iy ḏaysen. Niṯni ggwjen zi ṯuḏarṯ n Arebbi ƹlaḥsab ȓeqfaȓeṯ nni iy ḏaysen s ṯɣennant n wuȓawen nsen. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Fellsen qaƹ ḏeffaren ccehweṯ nsen u ṣafi, ḏaysen ijjen n zƹameṯ aḏ sxeḏmen i kuȓ nnuƹ n min isexnizen.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Walakin kenniw lla, maci amenni iy ṯȓemḏem x Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Wah, ṯȓemḏem x Ƹisa lḥaqiqa iy iǧan ḏayes iƹni meȓa ṯesȓam xas nican. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Iwa <char style="it">tuɣa ṯȓemḏem</char> aḏ tsemḥem ḏi ṭṭabiƹa nni nwem tuɣa ɣarwem qbeȓ. Liʼanna ṭṭabiƹa nni nwem ṯarecca ƹlaḥsab ccehweṯ nnes istwaɣarren. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" /><char style="it">Tuɣa ṯȓemḏem</char> aḏ tiȓim ḏ jḏiḏ zi ȓefhameṯ n ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />aḏ teggem ijjen n ṭṭabiƹa ṯenneɣni iƹni ḏ jḏiḏ, ijjen n ṭṭabiƹa iy d ɣa itwaxeȓqen amecnaw wenni n Arebbi ḏayes ȓḥaqq ḏayes min iṣfan.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Iḏen labud kuȓ ijjen zzaywem aḏ ibeƹƹeḏ zeg ixerriqen aḏ issiweȓ s ȓḥaqq ak wajjar nnes liʼanna neccin marra ḏ ijjen n jmaƹeṯ iy neǧa. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Ƹeṣṣbeṯ bȓa ma aḏ teggem ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ. War tejjaṯ ca ṯfuct axawem ṯeɣȓi kenniw ƹaḏ tƹeṣṣibem. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Iƹni war tejjaṯ ca abriḏ i Cciṭan aḏ yaḏef ḏeg wuȓawen nwem. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Wenni ig itacaren labud aḏ ibeƹƹeḏ zi ṯukkarḏa nni, aḏ ixḏem ijjen n ȓxeḏmeṯ ḏ ṯaṣebḥant s ifassen nnes bac aḏ iƹawen zzayes wenni iteḥḏajen.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />War tejjaṯ ca aḏ d iffeɣ zeg uqemmum nwem can wawaȓ ḏ aƹeffan. Lla, aḏ d iffeɣ zzayes ɣiȓ awaȓ aṣebḥan wenni itcejjaƹen ḏ wenni itḥellalen bac azzayes snefƹen yinni ḏas itesȓan. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />War sxeyyaqem ca Arruḥ iqeddsen n Arebbi iƹni wenni iy zi ṯetwaḍebƹem i Nhar nni iy ɣa ṯnejjmem. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Marra lƹuqda ḏ uɣḍab ḏ uƹeṣṣeb ḏ sḏaƹ ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ sbeƹƹḏem-ṯen xawem marra, u kkseṯ ƹaweḏ kuȓ nnuƹ n ȓeqbaḥeṯ. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Teggeṯ ȓxir ak wayawya, tḥinnam x wayawya. Semmḥem i wayawya mammec ḏawem iɣfar Arebbi ḏi Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Falihaḏa ggem mamc itegg Arebbi minzi kenniw ḏ ṯarwa nnes imƹizzen. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Ƹicem ḏi ȓemḥibbeṯ mamc igga Lmasiḥ wami ḏaneɣ iḥibb iṣeddeq xaneɣ ixef nnes am yijjen n ṣṣeḏqeṯ ṯufuḥ ḏ ijjen n dbiḥeṯ i Arebbi.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Wa labud war itiȓi walu jarawem zi lfasad niɣ ḏ min isexnizen niɣ ḏ ṭṭmaƹ ȓaḥeqqac manaya maci maƹqul i ṣṣaliḥin. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />U labud ƹaweḏ war itiȓi ca jarawem awaȓ aƹeffan niɣ ḏ wawaȓ ixwan niɣ ḏ nnukta ḏ ṯaƹeffant; Lla, itxeṣṣa aḏ yiȓi ccuker <char style="it">i Arebbi</char>. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Liʼanna wenni iteggen lfasad niɣ ḏ min isexnizen niɣ ḏ min iseḍmaƹen, iƹni netta ḏ wenni iƹebbḏen lʼaṣnam, aqa tessnem bȓa ccekk belli marra yinni iteggen manaya war ɣarsen bu lwareṯ ḏi ȓmulk n Lmasiḥ niɣ ḏi Arebbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />War tejjaṯ can ḥadd akenniw icmeṯ s wawaȓen nnes ixwan. Liʼanna x ssabab n ṯmesȓayin-a iy d ihewwa uɣḍab n Arebbi x yinni iy ṯ iƹeṣṣan. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Iḏen war temƹacareṯ ca akiḏsen.<verse eid="EPH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Cuf, ḏeg yijjen n ȓweqṯ kenniw tuɣa ḏ ṯaǧest, ȓexxu kenniw ṯḏewȓem ḏ ijjen n nnur ḏi Siḏi Arebbi. Iwa ƹiceṯ am ṯarwa n nnur. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Aqa nnur itarew-d min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan ḏ min iǧan nican ḏ min iǧan ḏ lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Meyyzeṯ ƹaweḏ min ḏas iteƹjiben i Siḏi Arebbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />War carrcem ca ḏi ȓexḏayem n ṯaǧest war tarwent ca, feḍḥem-ṯent. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Yinni war itṭiƹin ca. Meȓa nessiweȓ xasen ijjen n wawaȓ waha x min teggen s ṯnufra ataf a nseḏḥa. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Walakin min d infeḍḥen s nnur aḏ d imeḍhar <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />minzi ḏ nnur iy d ismeḍharen marra. X manaya iqqar <char style="it">Lkitab</char>:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">&lt;Faq cek a wenni iteṭṭṣen kkar-d zi ȓmewṯ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">axak iceƹceƹ Lmasiḥ s nnur nnes.&gt;<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Iḏen fa, rajƹaṯ ixef nwem xzareṯ mammec iy ɣa ṯƹicem. Maci aḏ tƹicem am yinni iy ḏi ṯeǧa ȓeqfaȓeṯ; Lla, ƹicem am yinni iy ḏi ṯeǧa ȓefhameṯ. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Staɣellam ȓweqṯ nwem mliḥ liʼanna nhuraṯ-a ḏ iƹeffanen. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Iwa war tiȓim ca bȓa ȓaƹqeȓ; Lla, fehmeṯ min ixes Siḏi Arebbi. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />War skareṯ ca s ccreb ig itawin ɣar lmadella n ssekra; Lla, ccarem s Arruḥ iqeddsen. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Siwȓem ag wayawya s wawaȓen n Zzabur ḏ lʼamdaḥ ḏ yizȓan ruḥiya. Ɣennjem, ggem lmusiqa i Siḏi Arebbi ḏeg wuȓawen nwem. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Cekkarem ȓebda Arebbi Babaṯneɣ x marra ṯimesȓayin ḏeg yisem n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="EPH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Ṯaƹem i wayawya ƹlaḥsab ȓuweqqar nwem i Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iryazen ḏ ṯemɣarin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />A ṯimɣarin, ṭaƹent i iryazen nkent mammec iy ṯṭaƹant i Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Ȓaḥeqqac aryaz itrayya x ṯemɣarṯ nnes mamc ƹaweḏ itrayya Lmasiḥ x jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin. Jmaƹeṯ-a isenjem-it Lmasiḥ u ḏ nettaṯ ig iǧan ḏ ddat nnes. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />U mammec ṯṭaƹa jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin i Lmasiḥ, amenni iy ɣa ṭaƹent ṯemɣarin i iryazen nsent ḏi marra.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25-26" />Ay iryazen, ḥibbem ṯimɣarin nwem mammec iḥibb Lmasiḥ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin iṣeddeq xas ixef nnes ḥima at issiṣfa. Yarri-t ḏ ṯamenqawiṯ wami t isireḏ s waman ḏ wawaȓ nnes. <verse eid="EPH 5:25-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Ḥima Lmasiḥ aḏ iqeddem jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin i yixef nnes tceƹciƹ ḏ ṯamqeddest war twessix war tecniq war ḏayes itiȓi bu ca n ȓƹib nneɣni. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Amenni kif-kif labud iryazen aḏ ḥibben ṯimɣarin nsen mamc tḥibban ddat nsen. Wenni itḥibban ṯamɣarṯ nnes ḏ ixef nnes iy itḥibba. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Cuf, ƹemmarṣ war iǧi ḥadd itƹiffa ddat nnes; Lla, itḏebbar-d xas itḥawaȓ xas. Amenni iy itegg Lmasiḥ ag jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Liʼanna neccin ḏ ṭrufaṯ n ddat nnes.<verse eid="EPH 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />
    <char style="it">Lkitab iqqar:</char> &lt;X manaya aryaz aḏ ismeḥ ḏi babas ḏ yemmas aḏ imun ak ṯemɣarṯ nnes, ṯnayen iḏsen aḏ ḏewȓen ḏ ijjen.&gt; <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Ḏeg wawaȓ-a mixef nessawaȓ ḏayes ijjen n ȓmaƹna inuffaren yuǧeɣ aṭṭas. Qqareɣ nec belli ȓmaƹna-ya issawaȓ x Lmasiḥ ak jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Innama, labud kuȓ ijjen zzaywem aḏ iḥibb ṯamɣarṯ nnes am mammec itḥibba ixef nnes. Ṯamɣarṯ u labud aḏ tweqqar aryaz nnes.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Iḥenjiren ḏ lwalidin nsen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Ay iḥenjiren ṭaƹem i lwalidin nwem ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ, aqa manaya nican ig iǧa. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" /><char style="it">Lkitab iqqar:</char> &lt;Weqqar babac ḏ yemmac.&gt; War ḏinni bu can ȓuṣiyeṯ nneɣni qbeȓ i ṯanita yuca-d akiḏes Arebbi ijjen n lwaƹd. <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" /><char style="it">Iƹni inna:</char> &lt;Ḥima aɣarek ṯiȓi marra mliḥ, ḥima aḏ iȓin wussan nnec ḏi ddunect-a ḏ izeyraren.&gt; <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Ay ibabaṯen, war seɣḍabem ca iḥenjiren nwem, rebbam-ṯen x ttarbiyeṯ ḏ useȓmeḏ n Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Isemɣan ḏ ayṯbab n isemɣan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Ay isemɣan, ṭaƹem i ayṯbab nwem ḏi ddunect-a, weqqarem-ṯen ggwḏem-ṯen s yijjen n wuȓ iṣfa amecnaw mammec ṯṭaƹam i Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Ṭaƹem-asen maci ɣir xmi ḏawem tbeddan ɣar uzeǧif waha aḏasen ṯƹejbem; Lla, aḏ tiȓim am isemɣan n Lmasiḥ aḏ teggem s ȓxaḍar nwem min ixes Arebbi. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Xeḏmem s yijjen n ȓxaḍar nwem axmi ṯxeddmem i Siḏiṯneɣ maci i iryazen. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Itxeṣṣa kenniw aḏ tessnem marra ȓxir iy ɣa ṯeggem akenniw ijaza xas Siḏiṯneɣ waxxa kenniw ḏ isemɣan niɣ ḏ ayṯbab nsen.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />U kenniw ay ayṯbab n isemɣan aḏasen ṯeggem kif-kif, maci aṯen tsiggwḏem. Aqa ṯessnem belli Bab nwem ḏ Bab nsen netta ḏ ijjen aqaṯ ḏeg ujenna, war itegg bu s wuḏemawen.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ȓesnaḥ iy d itasen zi Siḏi Arebbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Aqa awaȓ inu aneggaru: Jehḏeṯ s Siḏi Arebbi u s lquwwa nnes ṯameqqrant. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Ggem xawem marra ȓesnaḥ n Arebbi bac aḏ tesbeddem min xawem itciṭṭin Ibȓis. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Liʼanna neccin war netmenɣi ca ḍed i yiwḏan n uysum ḏ iḏammen. Lla, netmenɣa ḍed n ṯzemmar n ṯaǧest-a ṯanita n zman-a ḏ yinni ig iḥekkmen ḏ yinni ig ijehḏen ḏi ṯaǧest-a. Neccin netmenɣa ḍed n ccayaṭin iƹeffanen ig iǧan ḏeg imucan n ijennaṯen. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />S manaya ysiṯ ɣarwem marra ȓesnaḥ n Arebbi bac war trekkwiȓem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bac war trekkwiȓem ca ixes aḏ yini "bac ur trewwiȓem ci."</char></note> ca ḏi nhar n ccarr. U meȓa ṯeggim manaya marra, ataf aḏ tbeddem. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Beddem baƹda nican, ḥezzmem aḥezzam nni n lḥaqiqa iy teggem ḏi nneṣṣ. Ggem ƹaweḏ ṯjilit nni n ȓeḥḏiḏ n ȓḥaqq. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Qqnem ṯisiȓa i iḍaren nwem bac aḏ teswejḏem ixef nwem aḏ tbeccarem s Lʼinjil n ȓehna. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Aḏ teysim ȓebda lʼiman nwem am yijjen n lḥimaya x ufus iy zi ɣa ṯsexsim marra fȓičaṯ nni iḥarrqen n Uƹeffan nni <char style="it">n Ibȓis</char>. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Ysiṯ ƹaweḏ lkask n usefȓeṯ, sxeḏmem akiḏes ssif nni n Arruḥ iqeddsen ig iǧan ḏ awaȓ n Arebbi. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Marra ḍḍuruf iy ḏi ṯeǧam ttarem i Arebbi xasen s Arruḥ iqeddsen s marra lʼanwaƹ n ṯẓaǧiṯ ḏ dduƹaʼ. Sxeḏmem ȓaƹqeȓ nwem ḏi manaya, arrem-d ȓbaȓ nwem s yijjen n ṣṣbar, ttarem x marra ṣṣaliḥin. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Ttarem xafi nec ƹaweḏ meȓmi ma rezmeɣ aqemmum inu aḏayi muccen wawaȓen iy zi ɣa beccareɣ s ȓmaƹna inuffaren n Lʼinjil. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Ƹlaḥsab Lʼinjil-a wanita iy tiȓiɣ nec ḏ ijjen n ssafir carrfeɣ s snaseȓ. Ẓẓaǧem kenniw bac azzayes beccareɣ bȓa ma aḏ ggwḏeɣ ƹlaḥsab lwajib inu.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sȓam aneggaru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Rezzuɣ aḏ tessnem mamc ǧiɣ ḏ min teggeɣ. Ḏ uma Tuciq iƹizzen iy ḏawem ɣa yinin marra manaya. Netta ḏ ijjen n uxeddam nican ḏi Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Tsekkiɣ-awem-ṯ-iḏ i kenniw x ssabab-a wanita bac aḏ tessnem mamc ǧiɣ nec aḏ icejjeƹ uȓawen nwem.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Aḏ yiȓi ȓehna i ayṯmaṯneɣ ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ ak lʼiman zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Aḏ yiȓi arḍa i marra yinni ig itḥibban Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ s yijjen n ȓemḥibbeṯ war ṯfenni ca ƹemmarṣ.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>